	(text "Power estimation calculation\n1) Dev Board ; 100mA max @ 3.3V\n2) TLV9004 ; 2mA max @ 5V\n3) Leds ; 5mA @ 5V\n4) Passives ; 5mA @ 5V\n5) Regulator ; 10mA @ 5V\n\nTotal current consumption ; 0.500W\nCurrent requirement from 5V ; 122mA (max)\n	 \nWastage W ; 9.4*0.122 = 1.1468W\n\nMax temperature @ 47C Ambient = 47 + 35*0.94 = 87.138C"
